	(text_box "The owl familiar: put it on the owl's perch and it lights. L401\n(7 turns on each of 4 layers, 11.5 uH) with C401 (100 nF C0G)\nresonates at 148 kHz; the owl perch drives there. Orange lights\nfirst; purple joins as the drive rises (its blue-violet photons\ncarry about 3 eV against orange's 2.0). 150 R in each leg: the\n4.8 V bridge cannot push either LED past about 20 mA, whatever\nthe firmware does. At the cat's frequency (316 kHz) this tank\nshrinks the voltage and stays dark." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.7800 116.8400 0) (size 57.1500 16.5100)
